MODULE: LeaseUsesWrongSiloCount
TARGET: LeaseSnapshotExact
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the allocation snapshot uses an extra silo
PERTURBS: BeginLease

--- FIND
         [rate |-> rate, count |-> Cardinality(live), local |-> demand[s],
--- REPLACE
         [rate |-> rate, count |-> Cardinality(live) + 1, local |-> demand[s],
--- END
